## Task 7: Orchestration script — run-e2e.sh

**Files:**
- Create: `examples/user-mock/e2e/run-e2e.sh`
- Create: `examples/user-mock/e2e/start-server.mjs`

The orchestration script: pack runtime → build plugin (composite) → smithy build → install → build → start server with admin enabled → run tests → tear down.

